tack-a-benchmark-for-ml-repo-migration-0-c506adad28/","observation_id":"obs_c506adad28825d2b4f3de3c5e292070bbd219fb1a6fa5dc04956dc9de5be67a4","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:55:54Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"XStack 是一个用于评估 AI 代理跨框架、跨硬件迁移机器学习代码仓库的基准。代理需要把 PyTorch 仓库迁移为可在 TPU 上运行的 JAX 仓库，并通过基于原仓库结果的校准评分。","title":"XStack: A Benchmark for ML Repo Migration"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_900b4a716d23eeeba1fc1f3ed0745e9bf2849307f36b22634bfd8f18b5762017","internal_url":"/posts/20261108-arxiv-medgraph-maintaining-patient-state-with-graph-memo-4-7386abdb3f/","observation_id":"obs_7386abdb3f6e339849832071858eb2ebc72326ee114db3431f3e08612b35afc1","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:27:20Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"MedGraph 是一种面向长期医疗对话的图记忆方法，通过按患者归属事实、链接用药、诊断和测量记录，检索与问题时间相匹配的患者状态。它针对证据过时、混入他人健康信息及遗漏关键安全信息三类记忆错误进行改进。","title":"MedGraph: Maintaining Patient State with Graph Memory for Long-Term Medical Dialogue"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_55ddf86c9959f04eb5b28cb59a45eae2953dd8833eab0fc00702bb68a79ad96a","internal_url":"/posts/20261108-arxiv-the-power-of-meta-access-in-the-software-of-the-fu-4-edac4f01e1/","observation_id":"obs_edac4f01e102df97edc3a99bedad0e47900118ca8eb5521c8a967fd32e30b8c0","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:22:24Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"当前保存的是来源摘要，不代表论文全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"The Power of Meta Access in the Software of the Future --- Demonstrated on LLM Chat UIs and Chat AI"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_268a9176bddcc441740e381c3ce10e121fbc6387dae6c8721dd94327fec0b5ec","internal_url":"/posts/20261109-arxiv-benchmarks-as-software-terminal-bench-and-the-case-5-554e91182f/","observation_id":"obs_554e91182f04f9cb418bf145542d289d389ae347adfd9a24d1840e1d67e62fa3","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:18:39Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这项工作提出“持续验证”流程，通过社区反馈、任务产物、代理轨迹、自动检查和人工审核，持续维护智能体基准。研究对 Terminal-Bench 2.0 的审计发现约 30% 的任务存在问题，修复后形成 2.1 版；结果准确率提高超过 10 个百分点，榜单名次最多变化三位。","title":"Benchmarks as Software: Terminal-Bench and the Case for Continuous Benchmarks"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_0d40ab33453c1ffd45f8b8479389ebf75d40c8739f45f4bca22caeb204d73530","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-blogs_podcasts-how-amazon-marketplace-evaluates-content-quality-w-1-fad370bb7b/","observation_id":"obs_fad370bb7b6d436415c6f4ddb8a02e1562eca0569d93ed1a33f1eed45345207d","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:06:43Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这篇文章介绍一种面向电商商品详情页的内容质量评估方案：用视觉语言模型理解整页图片、文字与布局的协同效果，再结合 OCR 可读性信号和 CatBoost 分类器，依据专家标注输出质量判断。方案还利用 SHAP 解释评分依据，并在 Amazon SageMaker AI 上覆盖数据接入、模型托管、监控等环节。","title":"How Amazon Marketplace evaluates content quality with Amazon SageMaker AI"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_6946cf536ab340e76842588cd231fa56c3c087cc3499c2db340bd1952f46e8f6","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-arxiv-a-framework-for-context-enrichment-and-selective-r-0-1ba2bc1e63/","observation_id":"obs_1ba2bc1e6399e93d4fd435a7c22726067a41e0e5dc538d05675de7d9f0122609","published_at":"2026-11-04T18:58:23Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这篇论文研究如何通过有控制地补充提示上下文，减少大语言模型智能体在语义不变改写下行为的波动，同时保持对社会环境变化的合理响应。作者提出“上下文增强”和“选择性稳健性”框架，并在囚徒困境类博弈中进行了验证。","title":"A Framework for Context Enrichment and Selective Robustness in LLM Social Agents"}],"graph_node_id":"tag:大语言模型","id":"tag:大语言模型","related_topics":[{"cooccurrence":12,"graph_node_id":"tag:AI Agent","id":"tag:AI Agent","jaccard":0.521739,"topic":"AI Agent"},{"cooccurrence":9,"graph_node_id":"tag:Prompt 工程","id":"tag:Prompt 工程","jaccard":0.391304,"topic":"Prompt 工程"},{"cooccurrence":5,"graph_node_id":"tag:机器学习","id":"tag:机器学习","jaccard":0.217391,"topic":"机器学习"},{"cooccurrence":3,"graph_node_id":"tag:生成式 AI","id":"tag:生成式 AI","jaccard":0.130435,"topic":"生成式 AI"},{"cooccurrence":2,"graph_node_id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock","id":"tag:A